242
00:15:33,380 --> 00:15:41,380
The steel princess whirled around the battlefield, Asier Silva. Her strength and beauty captivated one and all.

243
00:15:41,380 --> 00:16:05,380
In terms of your looks, you resemble her a lot. Spitting image, even. But your magic powers another story. Your control is sloppy, to say the least. Makes it hard to believe you're her daughter. Her magic was refined to an unparalleled degree. It was so dignified. But despite your royal status, your magic is ugly and coarse. Work hard. Improve.

244
00:16:05,380 --> 00:16:13,380
Improve. You don't have her strength, but you're enough like her that you can overcome that.

245
00:16:14,380 --> 00:16:27,380
Okay. That's right. Asta's improving and he doesn't have any magic. Lacking ability doesn't mean you should run away or make excuses. And now I'm fired up. My body's all warm too.

246
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:31,380
Did it get hotter in here?

247
00:16:31,380 --> 00:16:39,380
You think you're hot stuff, huh? Bet you can't handle this heat. I'll wipe that little smirk right off your face!

248
00:16:40,380 --> 00:16:41,380
Oh, this is nothing for me.

249
00:16:42,380 --> 00:16:44,380
Now I'm really angry!

250
00:16:44,380 --> 00:16:51,380
Don't let him fool you, Leo! There's nothing cool about him! He just hates losing too much to quit! Gah! Now that I think about it, I'm the same way!

251
00:16:51,380 --> 00:16:55,380
Okay! Whoever stays in here the longest is the winner! Go!

252
00:16:57,380 --> 00:17:01,380
Hey! No fear! Using wind to cool the water down like that is totally cheating!

253
00:17:01,380 --> 00:17:07,380
Cheating? I'm just using my magic. You know, kinda like you're doing to heat up the water.

254
00:17:07,380 --> 00:17:13,380
The hell are you useless morons doing now? There are better ways to enjoy a hot spring!

255
00:17:13,380 --> 00:17:15,380
There are? Like what, Captain?

256
00:17:15,380 --> 00:17:21,380
Oh, I know strength training! It's gotta be strength training! Cause nothing's better than strength training unless it's more strength training!

257
00:17:21,380 --> 00:17:28,380
Shut it, cupcake! I swear you've got muscles where your brain should be. Nobody but you actually likes doing that crap.

258
00:17:29,380 --> 00:17:31,380
Please don't squish me, Captain Yami, sir!

259
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:35,380
Wait, it's not strength training? Another guy with muscles instead of brains.

260
00:17:35,380 --> 00:17:40,380
Okay, I give. Will you please let go of me and tell us a better way to enjoy the hot springs than strength training?

261
00:17:41,380 --> 00:17:44,380
Isn't it obvious? Getting a look into the women's bath.

262
00:17:44,380 --> 00:17:50,380
Wait, does he mean like, spying? I'm not sure that's such a good idea.

263
00:17:51,380 --> 00:17:53,380
If they caught us doing it, we'd be worse than dead.

264
00:17:54,380 --> 00:18:01,380
Listen to the bunch of you whining like a pack of beardless boys. A man's got to explore the unknown, even if it costs his life.

265
00:18:02,380 --> 00:18:05,380
Exploring the unknown? Is that what it means to be a man?

266
00:18:06,380 --> 00:18:11,380
Jeez, you idiots have a lot to learn. You wanna take a look too, don't you, Mr. Cool?

267
00:18:11,380 --> 00:18:14,380
Meh, not interested.

268
00:18:15,380 --> 00:18:19,380
I'm sick of you, boy, and your high and mighty act. Think you're a lady killer, huh?

269
00:18:20,380 --> 00:18:24,380
No, I don't. No, please stop. I'm just not that kind of guy, that's all.

270
00:18:25,380 --> 00:18:30,380
And exactly what kind of guy are you implying I am, Mr. Cool? Because I don't think I like it.

271
00:18:31,380 --> 00:18:38,380
Please let him go, Captain Yami! He plays it cool, but you lose a sheltered village can. As far as I know, he's got zero experience with women!

272
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:43,380
Now that I think about it, my brother likes baths too.

273
00:18:47,380 --> 00:18:52,380
Leopold, there's still so much that I need to teach you, but I'm not sure you're ready yet.

274
00:18:52,380 --> 00:18:53,380
Please! I'm ready!

275
00:18:54,380 --> 00:18:59,380
Wait, is it possible? Could this be what my brother wanted to teach me back then?

276
00:18:59,380 --> 00:19:06,380
Leopold, are you prepared to learn the art of spying on naked women?

277
00:19:06,380 --> 00:19:08,380
Heck yeah! I'm ready!

278
00:19:08,380 --> 00:19:10,380
That would never happen! No way!

279
00:19:10,380 --> 00:19:16,380
No. My brother wouldn't peep, not in a million years. In fact, I bet he'd beat up anyone who did.

280
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:26,380
What are you mumbling about over there, matchstick? Comparing yourself to Captain Sirius is a cop-out. You need to focus on moving past that guy.

281
00:19:27,380 --> 00:19:31,380
That's right. If I push myself, I can be more than my brother.

282
00:19:31,380 --> 00:19:43,380
What are you all standing around for? In some ways, this is a battle. Are you afraid of getting killed or something? Didn't your captain bring you all out here to prove you're not a bunch of cowards?

283
00:19:44,380 --> 00:19:45,380
He's right!

284
00:19:45,380 --> 00:19:48,380
You don't run away from a battle! You stand and fight!

285
00:19:48,380 --> 00:19:50,380
The mighty Crimson Lion Kings don't back down!

286
00:19:50,380 --> 00:19:56,380
Yeah! Time to peep! Let's show him who we are!

287
00:20:01,380 --> 00:20:03,380
Alright, let's do this!

288
00:20:03,380 --> 00:20:06,380
Um, what was that? It sounds like those disgusting men!

289
00:20:06,380 --> 00:20:12,380
Ah, they're so determined in the face of certain death. Maybe there's some hope left for them after all.

290
00:20:13,380 --> 00:20:15,380
They're coming here to peep at us!

291
00:20:15,380 --> 00:20:23,380
Well, they won't get a look at Char's immaculate body, that's for sure!

292
00:20:24,380 --> 00:20:26,380
Now, Earth magic!

293
00:20:26,380 --> 00:20:28,380
Gear Cliff Wall!

294
00:20:32,380 --> 00:20:34,380
Man, so close!

295
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:36,380
Go!

296
00:20:37,380 --> 00:20:41,380
We're the Crimson Lion Kings! A little wall won't keep us out!

297
00:20:41,380 --> 00:20:42,380
Yeah!

298
00:20:46,380 --> 00:20:47,380
Unbelievable.

299
00:20:50,380 --> 00:20:55,380
Right? Go on, kid. You climbed a volcano today. Scaling that wall should be a piece of cake.

300
00:20:55,380 --> 00:21:08,380
No! I've already got my heart set on somebody special and I refuse to betray her like that!

301
00:21:11,380 --> 00:21:12,380
Okay...

302
00:21:12,380 --> 00:21:13,380
Okay?

